      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, are you sure? i was reading online that mixing blood thinners like eliquis with nsaids like advil can make you bleed way more easily. also, my head is actually starting to feel kinda weird... like it's throbbing a lot harder now and i feel a bit nauseous. should i take a higher dose of advil to help with the throbbing, or is that when i should be worried?",
